  "ruleText": "Opt 105.01 Meetings. The board shall meet 6 times a year and at such additional times as shall be called for by the president or by vote of the board.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Opt 100) #5839, eff 6-17-94, EXPIRED: 6-17-00\n\nNew. #7325, eff 7-28-00",
